#####################################################################
# tri41_issue239_near.lgi
#
# polygon  : issue239_near.poly
# expect   : valid
# picture  : small
#
# WHAT:
#   the issue 239 shape with the tip only 1e-11 ABOVE the
#   diagonal, i.e. just inside the big upper-left cell.
#
# THE ORIGINAL CODE (before the Oct 2026 fix):
#   INVALID: the same three cells, which now OVERLAP (the tip
#   pokes 1e-11 into cell (1,2,3)). No error or warning.
#####################################################################
cmo / create / mo_tri / / / triplane
read / avs / issue239_near.poly / mo_tri
triangulate / clockwise
dump / avs / out_tri41_issue239_near.inp / mo_tri
finish
